{"url":"http://www.cobub.com/products/cobub-razor/","name":"Cobub Razor – Open Source Mobile Analytics | Cobub.com","note":"Cobub Razor is an Open Source and FREE Mobile Analytics solution. The user of Cobub Razor could collect data from Mobile Applications (Apps) via linking SDK, and make reporting &amp; analysis at server side.\nThe following reports and analytics matrix are provided in Cobub Razor:\nMobile Apps’ users &amp; distribution channel;\nEnd Users’ behavior in Apps;\nMobile devices statics &amp; grouping report;\nEvent data &amp; conversation rate in Apps Analytics;\nMobile Applications (Apps) error log (collapse) analytics.\nIn brief, Cobub Razor is an open source solution as an alternative to Google Mobile Analytics, Flurry.\nCobub Razor now support iOS (iPhone/iPad), Android and Windows Phone App Analytics. Benefits of choosing Cobub Razor:\nThe SDKs are small &amp; safe;\nUser can setup private database to avoid data leaks;\nIt provides the possibilities to customize the Mobile App Analytics.\n","tags":"opensource, analytics, mobile, "}
