{"url":"http://mysql-udf-global-user-variables.pureftpd.org/project/mysql-udf-global-user-variables","name":"MySQL Global User Variables UDF - Usage","note":"MySQL Global User Variables UDF\n  \n    \n      A MySQL extension to store persistent variables\n    \n    \n      This shared library adds simple user functions to MySQL in order to keep persistent shared variables in memory.\n\nThese variables and their values are available to all clients. Any data can be stored into these persistent\nvariables, including BLOBs.\n\nSince updates are atomic and way faster than MEMORY tables, this is an easy and efficient way to handle counters and sequences.\n","tags":""}
