{"url":"http://zathura.pwmt.org/","name":"http--zathura.pwmt.org-","note":"Zathura 还包括搜索、表单编辑、可点击链接、导出图像等其他功能。和 Linux 下大多数 PDF 查看器一样，Zathura 也基于 Poppler 库，另外它需要依赖 GTK+ 和 Cairo。zathura is a highly customizable pdf viewer based on the poppler pdf rendering libraryfeaturescommand completionnotification systemhighly customizableform editingfunctionalityopen, scroll, navigate, rotate, zoomsearchdocument informationshow and click linksimage exportsave attached filesprint whole document or specific sitesconfigurationthe complete configuration (appearance, shortcuts, commands and other settings) are stored in a serperate file (config.h) where you are able to change and edit everything to your wishesdependenciespoppler (0.10.7)gtk2 (2.17.2)cairo (1.8.8)\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://www.fireflymediaserver.org/","name":"Firefly Media Server Home Page","note":"mt-daapd是一款可以用来在Linux和其他POSIX标准兼容机上运行的iTunes（DAAP）的服务器程序。可以用来打造一款音乐文件服务器，帮你整理和传播你所收集的音乐。... to the Firefly Media Server project, previously known as \"mt-daapd\". Note: Please upgrade your version of Firefly. See the download page for important security information. The purpose of this project is built the best server software to serve digital music to the Roku Soundbridge and iTunes; to be able to serve the widest variety of digital music content over the widest range of devices. Current stable releases have been reported to run on Linux, all the BSDs, Solaris, AIX, and a variety of embedded devices such as the Linksys NSLU2, the Maxtor MSS, and the Buffalo Linkstation, to name but a few. Current beta (or \"nightly\") versions run on Microsoft Windows 2000 and XP, as well.\n","tags":"opera"}
