{"url":"http://www.stashboard.org/","name":"stashboard","note":"Stashboard is a status dashboard for APIs and software services. It's similar to the Amazon AWS Status Page or the Google Apps Status Page. Stashboard was originally written by Twilio to provide status information on its Voice and SMS APIs. Stashboard is designed to provide a generic status dashboard for any hosted service or API. The code can be downloaded, customized, and run on any Google App Engine account. Track multiple different API or SaaS services Set custom status messages and icons such as Up/Down Show historical status for each service Runs on Google App Engine so it's independent of your infrastructure (unless your app is on GAE) Full REST API for both getting and setting status information CNAME to http://status.yourapp.com Stashboard is written in Python and hosted on Google App Engine. Head over to stashboard.appspot.com to play with the latest version.\n","tags":"appengine,monitoring,status,cloud,api,opensource,online_services,sysadmin,linux,dashboard"}
{"url":"http://sourceforge.net/projects/mbldr/","name":"mbldr (Master Boot LoaDeR) mbldr (Master Boot LoaDeR)","note":"Get mbldr (Master Boot LoaDeR) at SourceForge.net. Fast, secure and free downloads from the largest Open Source applications and software directory. mbldr is a boot loader which fits into first sector of an HDD (MBR). It allows to choose which partition to boot and is intended to replace an MBR coming with DOS/Windows (fdisk /mbr). It may boot OSes above 1024cyl, Linux/BSD are also supported.\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://typo3.org/","name":"typo3.org TYPO3 Content Management System - Developer Resource","note":"Typo3是一个内容管理系统(CMS)，它功能丰富，同时也是最容易学习的系统之一。有超过300个注册开发者经常为其开发新的功能，Typo3提供了超过800个可用的扩展，并且不断有新的扩展加入进来。在选择一个CMS时，您经常要在可用性和功能性方面做出选择，但Typo3既提供了可用性，又提供了丰富的功能。使用向导功能，管理员可以使用提供的HTML模版创建站点。Typo3使用Typoscript，一个脚本系统，提供很多工具，让您方便快速的访问数据。它还提供一个工具 - Extension Kickstarter，使用它，您可以创建自己的扩展。虽然掌握Typo3的所有方面和用法需要花费一些时间，但创建一个基本的站点是非常简单的，有很多指南可以提供帮助。这个CMS可以方便的限制或者约束某些用户或者组的访问，提供了丰富的安全特性。内容编辑可以在30分钟内学会使用Typo3！它可以运行在Windows, Linux和Mac平台上，与大多数浏览器兼容。文本编辑使用与Office软件相同的图标。Typo3有一个功能丰富的文本编辑器，一个所见即所得的编辑器，可以添加或者删除按钮和风格。它有内置的拼写检查器，大多数功能旁边都有帮助图标。Typo3还可以在一个目录树格式中显示文件管理功能，内容编辑可以方便快速的定位页面和文件。直观的用户界面节省了时间，简化了操作。Typo在质量和易用性方面不逊于大部分的商业系统。市场上的CMS系统如此之多，有时很难做出选择，但Typo3会很快证明，您选择它是正确的。\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://www.dirvish.org/","name":"Dirvish","note":"Dirvish is a fast, disk based, rotating network backup system. With dirvish you can maintain a set of complete images of your filesystems with unattended creation and expiration. A dirvish backup vault is like a time machine for your data. Dirvish was originally created by jw schultz .\n","tags":"opera"}
