{"url":"http://www.eucalyptus.com/","name":"Eucalyptus Systems Inc","note":"Eucalyptus is an open-source system for implementing on-premise private and hybrid clouds using the hardware and software infrastructure that is in place, without modification.Eucalyptus是一个开源云计算项目，它开发的软件软件允许企业创建内部云环境，并且Amazon的EC2(Elastic Compute Cloud)是兼容的，现在它发布了自己的第一款商业产品----- Eucalyptus企业版。该产品使用Vmware的虚拟化技术（包括vSphere 和 ESX），在转换他们的虚拟化数据中心成为本地计算云时给企业更多选择。 Eucalyptus在九月份推出了它的EEE（Eucalyptus企业版），它允许企业使用Vmware的产品（尤其是vSphere 4虚拟化平台、ESX和ESXi hypervisors）来创建一个本地云计算环境。 除此之外，EEE也支持其他的hypervisors包括开源Xen和KVM.。 Eucalyptus是与一个在加利福尼亚大学的研究性项目，创建了一个使企业能够使用它们内部IT资源（包括服务器、存储系统、网络设备）的开源界面，来建立能够和Amazon EC2兼容的云。\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://www.greensql.net/","name":"GreenSQL | Open Source SQL Database Security, SQL Injection Prevention","note":"GreenSQL is a Database Security solution.\nGreenSQL is an Open Source database firewall used to protect databases from SQL injection attacks. GreenSQL works as a proxy and has built in support for MySQL and PostgreSQL. The logic is based on evaluation of SQL commands using a risk scoring matrix as well as blocking known db administrative commands (DROP, CREATE, etc). Commercial version of GreenSQL supporting Microsoft SQL Server is available at GreenSQL.com database security solutions.\n","tags":""}
{"url":"http://code.google.com/p/paste-img/","name":"paste-img - Project Hosting on Google Code","note":"Paste_Img.pl¶A scripts to paste images to several on-line image hosts with perl-gtk GUI. The image url will be printed at the status-bar and shown with a bubble as soon as the image is successfully uploaded. Also the url will be saved to the PRIMARY selection area, you can paste it anywhere with the middle-button of the mouse. Depends: libwww-mechanize-perl, libnet-dbus-perl, xsel\n","tags":""}
