{"url":"http://www.bada.com/about/","name":"bada bada","note":"Samsung bada is a new open platform that enables rich user experience in applications on Samsung mobile devices.Samsung’s expertise in the mobile fieldSamsung has about 20 years of experience in delivering the best-in-class mobile technology and devices to consumers across the globe.Throughout its history, Samsung has focused on delivering a truly unique and innovative mobile experience, while upholding the highest standards of quality to consumers. Samsung bada is a culmination of Samsung’s deep expertise and experience in the mobile industry. It represents an important step in the journey to deliver the platform of choice for developers and consumers.Purpose of badaMore and more people want the rich and connected application-experiences that are currently only available for smartphone consumers. Samsung has developed bada to make these exclusive smartphone experiences available to everyone.Key features of badaSamsung design principles aim to deliver simple, intuitive, and innovativ...\n","tags":"opera"}
