{"url":"http://projects.dumbotics.com/dumbo/","name":"dumbo @ GitHub","note":"Dumbo is a project that allows you to easily write and run Hadoop programs in Python (it’s named after Disney’s flying circus elephant, since the logo of Hadoop is an elephant and Python was named after the BBC series “Monty Python’s Flying Circus”). More generally, Dumbo can be considered a convenient Python API for writing MapReduce programs.\n","tags":"tweetthis, python, hadoop"}
