{"url":"http://www.tinycorelinux.com/","name":"Tinycore Welcome to Tiny Core Linux","note":"Tiny Core Linux is a very small (10 MB) minimal Linux Desktop. It is based on Linux 2.6 kernel, Busybox, Tiny X, Fltk, and Jwm. The core runs entirely in ram and boots very quickly.It is not a complete desktop nor is all hardware completely supported. It represents only the core needed to boot into a very minimal X desktop typically with wired internet access.The user has complete control over which applications and/or additional hardware to have supported, be it for a desktop, a netbook, an appliance, or server, selectable by the user by installing additional applications from online repositories, or easily compiling most anything you desire using tools provided.Tiny Core Linux是一份很小（10 MB）的最低限度Linux桌面。它基于Linux 2.6内核、Busybox、Tiny X、FLTK图形用户界面、JWM窗口管理器，全部运行在内存中。它并非一份完整的桌面，也不完整支持所有的硬件；它只代表能引导进入一份最小X窗口桌面所需的核心内容，典型情况下可包含对有线网络的访问。这份最小桌面可以通过从在线软件仓库安装额外应用软件来进行扩展。\n","tags":"opera"}
