{"url":"http://sourceforge.net/projects/aquosa/","name":"AQuoSA Adaptive QUality Of Service Architecture","note":"Get Adaptive QUality Of Service Architecture at SourceForge.net. Fast, secure and free downloads from the largest Open Source applications and software directory. AQuoSA is an open architecture for enhancing the Linux kernel with soft real-time capabilities. A well-designed API allows applications to benefit of kernel-level timing guarantees and feedback-based QoS control (essential in multimedia applications).\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://www.ultravpn.fr/","name":"UltraVPN - A Free VPN","note":"UltraVPN - A Free VPNUltraVPN, how to use UltraVPN is a client/server SSL VPN solution based on OpenVPN. It encrypts and anonymizes your network connection.UltraVPN is a simple user interface to connect or disconnect to our VPN servers. To use UltraVPN, you need to right click on a traybar icon (on the bottom right of your screen) that looks like a computer with a red screen. After right clicking on it, choose \"connect\".\n","tags":"opera"}
