{"url":"http://www.qtchina.net/","name":"Qtchina.net","note":"NullGet是使用Qt编写的，运行于多种平台的GUI界面的多线程多协议断点续传下载软件。 使用NullGet可以轻松下载网络的多种协议的数据流，加快下载速度，支持断点续传，目前支持的协议有：HTTP，HTTPS，FTP，MMS，RTSP。而且它能运行于当前大多数流行的操作系统，包括Windows，Linux，FreeBSD等。 NullFXP 是一个基于Qt 4 开发的SFTP 客户端软件。目前已经实现基本的多文件上下传功能。详细信息查看本站项目说明页面。 我们的目标是打造一个开源的，跨平台的，多线程的，运行稳定的下载软件，另一个就是整理Qt库开发跨平台GUI应用程序的相关资料。\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://www.turnkeylinux.org/","name":"TurnKey Linux Virtual Appliance Library | Virtual Appliances for Virtual Machines, Cloud Computing and Bare Metal","note":"Turnkey Linux is an open source project developing a free virtual appliance library that features the very best server-oriented open source software. Each virtual appliance is optimized for ease of use and can be deployed in just a few minutes on bare metal, a virtual machine and in the cloud.\n\nWhy? Because everything that can be easy, should be easy.\n\nPackaging a solution as a virtual appliance can be incredibly useful because it allows you to leverage guru integration skills to build ready to use systems (I.e., turn key solutions) that just work out of the box with little to no setup.\n","tags":""}
{"url":"http://www.doit.im/gtd_c.jsp","name":"Doit.im - 随时, 随地, 随你!","note":"Doit.im，是一款跨平台的任务管理工具，并支持与手机同步。Doit.im采用优秀的任务管理理念(GTD理念)，有条不紊地组织规划各项任务，轻松应对各项庞大繁杂的工作，在感受无压工作乐趣的同时，畅享高效工作的成就感！\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://www.yakitome.com/","name":"YAKiToMe! - Free Text To Speech (TTS) - Free Audio Book Podcast","note":"Free text to speech (TTS). Podcast audio books in English, Spanish, French and German with AT&T; Natural Voices TTS. Listen to any electronic text: PDF, MS Word, web page, plain text, RSS feed and email. YAKiToMe! turns any electronic text into an audio book podcast that you can share and download. YAKiToMe! uses the world's best text to speech from AT&T; Natural Voices and others. YAKiToMe! reads text in English, Spanish, French and German. You select male or female speakers and control reading speed and pronunciation. YAKiToMe! reads PDF, MS Word, email, RSS feeds, text files, and web pages. YAKiToMe! outputs audio mp3 and wav files that you can listen to, download, podcast and share with friends. Free text to speach. Free audio books. Free podcasting. Podcast for free. Podcast with text to speech. 又一个功能强大的在线转换文本成语音(Text To Speech)的服务，支持将English，Spanish，French，German四种语言的文字以及.doc .pdf .txt .html.xml等格式的文档转换成mp3.wav格式。\n","tags":"opera"}
