{"url":"http://www.pandion.be/","name":"Pandion An easy to use XMPP and Jabber client","note":"Pandion is an open source instant messaging client for XMPP networks.Keep in touch with friends or collaborate with colleagues using Pandion instant messenger. Pandion is free software and uses open standards. Pandion is designed for ease of use and secure communication.System requirements: Windows XP, Vista, 7Windows中的XMPP客户端\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://freshmeat.net/projects/baruwa","name":"Baruwa freshmeat.net","note":"Baruwa（斯瓦希里语的信件或电子邮件）是一个mailwatch启发的Web 2.0的邮件传输前端。它提供了一个简单易用的用户界面来查看详细的邮件传输处理的邮件，以及执行诸如释放隔离的邮件，垃圾邮件学习，白名单和黑名单地址操作等Baruwa实施Web 2.0功能（AJAX）技术在认为合适的。图形是在客户端上实现使用SVG的一面。该报告还提供了一种易于使用查询生成器的功能;结果可以显示为邮件列表或色彩缤纷的漂亮图形绘制。初始版本的目标是在mailwatch解决目前存在的各种夸克。 Baruwa最初将在更换为mailwatch下降，而未来的版本将打破mailwatch兼容性。这使缓和到新的最终用户界面。Baruwa (Swahili for letter or mail) is a mailwatch-inspired Web 2.0 MailScanner front-end. It provides an easy to use interface for users to view details of messages processed by MailScanner as well as perform operations such as releasing quarantined messages, spam learning,whitelisting and blacklisting addresses, etc. Baruwa has implemented Web 2.0 features (AJAX) where deemed fit. Graphing is implemented on the client side using SVG. It also provides reporting functionality with an easy to use query builder; results can be displayed as message lists or graphed as colorful and pretty graphs. The goal of the initial version will be to address the various quarks that exist in mailwatch ...\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://code.google.com/p/ipmsg4linux/","name":"ipmsg4linux - Project Hosting on Google Code","note":"ipmsg for linux platform, (Text model) funcs: fucn: ========= you can use alias too!...eg: list use ls to replace! func alias usage list ls list refresh rf refresh send send send user(or host,ip) message sendall sa sa message sendfile sf sf user(or host,ip) filename listfile lf lf accept ac accept file name(or msgNo:fileNo) cancel ca cancel file name(or MsgNo ,or cancel all pwd pwd pwd cd cd cd dir dir dir dir ! ! !command args... exit quit exit help ? helplinux 平台的IPmsg(飞鸽传书),支持发送,接收消息及文件,群发消息等.\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://code.google.com/p/tint2/","name":"tint2 - Project Hosting on Google Code","note":"tint2 is a simple panel/taskbar unintrusive and light (memory / cpu / aestetic). We try to get 'virtual desktop' and 'multi-monitor' easier to use. We follow freedesktop specifications. 0.8 featurespanel with taskbar, systray, clock and battery status easy to customize : color/transparency on font, icon, border and background pager like capability : send task from one workspace to another, switch workspace multi-monitor capability : one panel per monitor, show task from current monitor customize mouse event window manager's menu tooltip\n","tags":"opera"}
