{"url":"http://www.continuent.com/community/lab-projects/sequoia","name":"Tungsten Lab Projects: Sequoia","note":"Continuent Tungsten offers advanced replication solution with advanced cluster management and intelligent load-balancing. Continuent Tungsten offers a wealth of solutions for MySQL, PostgreSQL and Oracle users, providing the following key features:\n\nAutomatic Failover with Automatic Slave Promotion\nAutonomic Cluster Management\nHigh Performance Parallel Replication\nApplication Scaling with Intelligent SQL Routing\n100% Data Protection with DRBD integration\nBuilt-in Back-up Integration\nDisaster Recovery over WAN\nConsistency Checks and Flush Operations to Protect Data\nHeterogeneous Database Replication\nData Integration with Multi-database Support\nBi-Directional Replication for Multi-site Clustering\nDatabase Sharding Support\n\nFlexible Replication Event Filtering\nDatacenter and Cloud Operation\n","tags":""}
{"url":"http://www.simple-groupware.de/cms/","name":"Simple Groupware - open source groupware and cms","note":"Simple Groupware &amp; CMS is an open source enterprise groupware that offers email, calendaring, contacts, tasks, document management, project management, synchronization with Outlook and cell phones, full-text search and many more.\nSimple Groupware is s free web based groupware solution written in PHP that combines standards like RSS, iCalendar, vCard, IMAP, POP3, SMTP, CIFS, CSV, WebDAV, LDAP and SyncML under one platform.\n","tags":""}
