{"url":"http://www.tiddlywiki.com/","name":"TiddlyWiki - a reusable non-linear personal web notebook","note":"TiddlyWiki is a single html file which has all the characteristics of a wiki - including all of the content, the functionality (including editing, saving, tagging and searching) and the style sheet. Because it's a single file, it's very portable - you can email it, put it on a web server or share it via a USB stick.TiddlyWiki就是一个这样的软件。TiddlyWiki是基于html，css，javascript实现的轻量级个人wiki。利用它，可以轻松实现诸如日记本，记事本，个人书签。虽然只是一个html文件，但是功能非常强大，支持各种语法，主题，皮肤和插件，还能实现网上同步备份的功能，绝对不会让你失望。（很多功能我也在摸索实践，所以就不一一列举了，呵呵）\n","tags":"opera"}
