{"url":"http://www.inthepoche.com/?navlang=en","name":"poche","note":"What is poche? poche is a tool to manage your reading list. Save a link to read it later. poche is the free and open source alternative to Pocket, Readability and Instapaper.  Unlike to the others, poche is free et open source : all your datas belong to you!  Some features:  adding, deleting, archiving and setting as favorite a link import from pocket / readability / instapaper share links by email and on twitter a design adapted to tablets and smartphones multi languages (very soon!) multi users (very soon!) update notification in configuration screen many storage modes (sqlite, mysql, postgresql) many templates ...\n","tags":"opensource, php, reader"}
