{"url":"http://code.google.com/p/autosetup/","name":"autosetup - Project Hosting on Google Code","note":"Linux的开源安装对初学者来说有些麻烦,所以把它做成自动安装包,供大家学习!运行平台均为centos5.1 AutoIM_Porxy 是基于squid的，自动安装的http代理，可用于QQ等IM软件 (v1.0.1) AutoSVN 是基于apache+subversion+viewve的版本控制工具 (v0.1.1) AutoVPN 是基于pptp+freeradius+mysql的，可用WEB管理(v1.0.0) 下载地址:http://www.namipan.com/d/2cce800e6dcdfa5b15507c14a0ae6d69e853ed8b00206b01 AutoCDN 是基于easy-cdn所做的自运安装版，详细见easy-cdn站点 (v1.0.5) AutoMPN 是基于mysql+php+nginx的动态web服务器,专为小内存优化 (v0.0.1) AutoMAP 是基于mysql+apache+php的动态WEB服器.(v0.1.11) AutoOVPN 是基于openvpn+freeradius+mysql的，可用web管理(v1.5.2) xen-cli 是xen的命令管理工具 (v0.0.1)\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://sourceforge.net/projects/stun/","name":"STUN Client and Server library","note":"Get STUN Client and Server library at SourceForge.net. Fast, secure and free downloads from the largest Open Source applications and software directory. This project implements a simple STUN server and client on Windows, Linux, and Solaris. The STUN protocol (Simple Traversal of UDP through NATs) is described in the IETF RFC 3489, available at http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc3489.txt\n","tags":"opera"}
