{"url":"http://multignometerm.sourceforge.net/","name":"MULTI GNOME TERMINAL - HOME PAGE","note":"Hello, my name is Cristiano De Michele (demichel@na.infn.it) and I'm a Phd Student in Physics, I use GNOME as my desktop and I love it, though not its terminal. So I decided to extend the gnome-terminal, adding new powerful and useful features (I hope!).If you have problems running or compiling the program don't hesitate to contact me, preferably through the mailing lists or tracking pages. I would also be very happy to receive your comments and impressions - see the Feedback page or join me on the MGT channel of the irc.gnome.org server. Use any IRC client, such as xchat, to connect to the server and then join channel #mgt.Enjoy!\n","tags":"opera"}
