{"url":"http://www.x2go.org/","name":"x2go - server based computing index","note":"x2go is an open source terminal server project offering a comprehensive \"server based computing\" solution. x2go provides you with access to your desktop as an individual as well as a corporate user - from within your own network and via the internet. x2go is not limited to any particular hardware, it supports a variety of devices and architectures. x2go is open source software.x2go is an open source terminal server project offering a comprehensive \"server based computing\" solution. Combining the advantages of existing systems it features ease of use, performance and scalability. x2go provides you with access to your desktop as an individual as well as a corporate user - from within your own network and via the internet. x2go is not limited to any particular hardware, it supports a variety of devices and architectures. x2go is open source and open minded. The project also offers you a command line client for you to implement your own client applications and ideas. Like any open source...\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://code.google.com/p/centbar/","name":"centbar - Project Hosting on Google Code","note":"从 fbpanel 修改而来。 以“简洁实用，兼顾美观”为原则重写 fbpanel增加功能、方便使用20090426 centbar-1.20 对程序作了较大改动：去掉一些觉得无用的插件；把功能配置与样式配置分开，支持“主题”；增加多语言支持开始菜单：重写 menu 插件。支持菜单图标大小设置，在“系统菜单”的“设置”菜单项下面增加 “centbar主题” 选择工作空间：去掉来自 fbpanel 的 pager，新增的 pgman 改名为 workspace命令按钮：launcherbar 重写，改名为 dock任务列表：去掉来自 fbpanel 的 taskbar，保留新增的 taskman监视器：为 monitor 增加“仪表背景”时钟：去掉来自 fbpanel 的 dclock，保留 tclock 且改名为 clock以上插件的外观（按钮、文字、图标）都改用 cairo+pango 画，现在能“和谐地”支持透明和背景图片自带四种默认主题：透明、黑色、蓝色、轻灰色（如上图）改变配置文件格式：参考《centbar使用与配置》centbar现在可以正常地放置在屏幕四条边上，自动隐藏也可正常使用因配置更改，来自fbpanel的那个简单GUI配置暂时没有用（可以打开，但不会保存结果）\n","tags":"opera"}
