{"url":"http://p7zip.sourceforge.net/","name":"P7ZIP","note":"7ZIPp7zip is a port of 7za.exe for POSIX systems like Unix (Linux, Solaris, OpenBSD, FreeBSD, Cygwin, AIX, ...), MacOS X and also for BeOS and Amiga.7za.exe is the command line version of 7-zip, see http://www.7-zip.org/.7-Zip is a file archiver with highest compression ratio.Since 4.10, p7zip (like 7-zip) supports little-endian and big-endian machines.J7ZipJ7zip is a JAVA port of 7zr.exe2007-02-04 : support BCJ filter2006-12-10 : First public version (support only extracting files compressed with LZMA and BCJ2 filter)TODO : creating archives, support encryption, support multi-thread, ...\n","tags":"opera"}
