{"url":"http://sites.inka.de/bigred/devel/cipe.html","name":"CIPE - Olaf Titz","note":"CIPE - a software package to build encrypting IP routers. It works by tunneling IP packets in encrypted UDP packets. The protocol is designed to be lightweight and simple. Special care has been taken to make this work over dynamic addresses, NAT and SOCKS proxies. Implementations are currently available for Linux and Windows.\n","tags":"opera"}
