{"url":"http://gunicorn.org/","name":"Green Unicorn - Welcome","note":"Gunicorn 'Green Unicorn' is a Python WSGI HTTP Server for UNIX. It's a pre-fork worker model ported from Ruby's Unicorn project. The Gunicorn server is broadly compatible with various web frameworks, simply implemented, light on server resources, and fairly speedy. \r\nFeatures\r\nNatively supports WSGI, Django, and Paster\r\nAutomatic worker process management\r\nSimple Python configuration\r\nMultiple worker configurations\r\nVarious server hooks for extensibility\r\nCompatible with Python 2.x &gt;= 2.5\n","tags":""}
