{"url":"https://code.google.com/p/libpyhdfs/","name":"libpyhdfs - Python wrapper for libhdfs - Google Project Hosting","note":"libpyhdfs is a Python extension module which wraps the C API in libhdfs to access HDFS (Hadoop file system).\n\nSample usage:\n\nimport pyhdfs\n\nfs = pyhdfs.connect(\"192.168.1.1\", 9000)\npyhdfs.get(fs, \"/path/to/remote-src-file\", \"/path/to/local-file\")\n\nf = pyhdfs.open(fs, \"/test/xxx\", \"w\")\npyhdfs.write(fs, f, \"fuck\\0gfw\\n\")\npyhdfs.close(fs, f)\n\npyhdfs.disconnect(fs)\nsee APIs page for the supported APIs.\n\nsee INSTALL page for installation information.\n","tags":"hadoop, python, hdfs"}
