{"url":"http://chicago.sourceforge.net/xlhtml/","name":"xlhtml Homepage","note":"An Excel viewer written in TCL/TK, which uses xlhtml as a backend \n\nThis program requires tkhtml. It uses this to display the HTML output of xlhtml. I \nhighly recommend it for anyone doing TCL/TK developmenet, that needs \nan HTML rendering engine. \nA batch converter which converts all the Excel files in the current directory to html, using xlhtml. \n\nThe converter has been tested on the following systems: \nSlackware 8.0 \nMac OS 10.1\nFreeBSD 4.3\nA utility to extract charts from xls files. It currently only works from apache as a cgi-bin script. \nA library that is needed for the chart utility.\n","tags":"opera"}
