{"url":"http://easyvz.org/","name":"easyVZ - Server Virtualization and Virtual Server Management made easy )","note":"easyVZ is a free GUI to OpenVZ Admins and ClientseasyVZ is a GPL ('free') GUI Control-Panel to OpenVZ. OpenVZ is is an open source virtualization solution built on Linux. OpenVZ creates multiple, isolated, secure 'Virtual Servers' ('VS') on a single physical server/machine/node/box. Each VS performs and executes exactly like a stand-alone server; VS's can be rebooted independently and have root access, users, IP addresses, memory, processes, files, applications, Linux version, system libraries and configuration files. Like the OpenVZ project, easyVZ is distributed under GPL. It is an open source project and intended to provide access to the code and ultimately for the open source community to test, develop and further (a GUI to) OS virtualization.easyVZ can support hundreds of VS's on a single physical server due to the use of OpenVZ's operating system-level virtualization, allowing VS's to have many different distributions of Linux.easyVZ - what the current version can do for you......\n","tags":"opera"}
