{"url":"http://www.delix-os.com/","name":"delix系统","note":"Delix 是专针对上网本量身定做独立开发的Linux系统，内核及启动方式进行了优化，资源占用少、功耗低、开机速度快、运行效率高。整个系统软件只占约2G的硬盘容量；软件界面经过优化和修改，完全适应上网本的屏幕分辨率；内置OFFICE办公软件、防火墙，内置英汉词典支持屏幕取词，内置互联网浏览器、全功能聊天工具（兼容QQ\\MSN\\ICQ等市面上绝大部分聊天软件），全格式邮件工具；Delix系统安全，不中毒，不感染木马程序，不产生磁盘碎片，必须键入开机密码方可开机；Delix界面漂亮，切换方便，永不down机，支持BT下载。独立设计的双桌面系统，既保持传统桌面的简洁使用，使Windows用户能够很快上手，又有炫酷的媒体中心桌面，让用户体验全新的视觉效果及操作方式。\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://www.fastweb.com.cn/","name":"CDN 网站加速专家——更快更好·和谐网络","note":"Content Delivery Network (CDN), Fastweb Technology Co., Ltd. (Fastweb), is the leading service provider in China for online content delivery (CDN) and accelerating network traffic. The Fastweb content delivery and distribution (CDN) network and platform provide fast, reliable, secure, scalable and cost-effective services. It’s the content delivery network (CDN) of choice for web content (image, photo, software, files, video, game, music, social media, digital media, digital asset, and more) delivered to users in China. By extending its services to co-location services (IDC) and hosting services, Fastweb also provides total IT outsourcing services for companies in the Internet and content business.快网\n","tags":"opera"}
