{"url":"http://code.google.com/p/molniya/","name":"molniya - Project Hosting on Google Code","note":"XMPP gateway for NagiosMolniya presents an IM interface for Nagios, so you can receive and react to problem notifications from Nagios in a convenient way. It uses XMPP (as well as SMTP) for communications. In addition to receiving notifications, you can request status reports, check services, and acknowledge outages. Version 0.2.1 is out; it fixes a few small but serious bugs in 0.2. Molniya has been in daily use and works reliably and well. The author uses it as his primary Nagios notification mechanism. See MolniyaFeatures for details on its capabilities, and GettingStarted for setup information. Also, there is an emerging RoadMap for future development.\n","tags":"opera"}
