{"url":"https://github.com/shuttler/nessDB","name":"shuttler/nessDB · GitHub","note":" nessDB is a fast Key-Value database(embedded), which is written in ANSI C with BSD LICENSE and works in most POSIX systems without external dependencies.\n\n  nessDB is very efficient on disk-based random access.\n\n  From Version 2.0, nessDB uses Small-Splittable Tree (SST), it's a Cache-oblivious write-optimized structure, for more details, please refer to documentations which in 'spec' folder.\n  Insert cost is O((log N)/B), and query is O(log N).\n\n  \n  V2.0 FEATURES\n  =============\n  a. Better performances on Random-Read/Write\n  b. Using Small-Splittable Tree as storage engine\n  c. Using fractional cascading to speed up search\n  d. Cache-oblivious write-optimized structure\n  e. Using fractional cascading to speed up search\n","tags":"nosql, "}
{"url":"http://www.dhis.org/","name":"Dynamic Host Information Services","note":"DHIS是一个客户端服务器的系统架构，主要用于更新的DNS主机的动态IP地址。与DHIS您可以让您的计算机始终承认并在互联网上提供相同的唯一的名称，即使其IP地址频繁更改。DHIS是理想的宽带家庭用户永远在线的互联网连接解决方案，具有动态IP地址，但仍希望运行一个家庭服务器可通过其他人在任何时候都无缝。为了使用它你要么需要一个路由器或客户端，支持网络更新或某个软件称为DHIS客户端，您可以在这里找到，加上DHIS注册帐户。DHIS is a client-server based system architecture primarily meant for updating DNS for hosts that have dynamic IP addresses. With DHIS you can have your computer always recognised and available on the Internet with the same unique name, even if its IP address changes frequently. We provide free hostnames under the dhis.org domain.支持ipv6的动态域名\n","tags":"opera"}
