{"url":"http://freevo.sourceforge.net/","name":"Freevo Media Centre Home Theatre Platform HTPC & PVR","note":"Imagine a world where the tv guide is liquid, where the time slots are organised to suit your schedule. Imagine a place you can store all of your music, movies and photos, for you and your family to enjoy. Imagine having access to all your classic games, upto the minute weather and news reports, Imagine doing all of this for free. What a wonderful world that would be...Stop imagining - Get FreevoFreevo，它主要的功能是能在PC上看电视（Linux下），Freevo可以在带电视机和遥控器的PVR上使用，也可以在普通的PC上使用，当然，除了用它来收看电视，我们还可以用它看电影，听音乐等等。Freevo使用Python+SDL开发，采用mplayer和xine来进行播放。这次更新的1.7.3版本添加了中文支持。根据O’Reilly对Rob Shortt（Freevo主要开发者）的访谈（访谈详情）， 总结了Freevo较MythTV的差异。（以下引用自Jesrv’s Blog）* Freevo 不需要 X Window System，而 MythTV 需要* Freevo 不需要 MySQL 支持 (使用轻便的 SQLite)，而 MythTV 需要* Freevo 不需要复杂的 Apache (使用小巧的 Twisted)，而 MythTV 需要* Freevo 的 software stack 较MythTV 精简許多\n","tags":"opera"}
