{"url":"http://appwebserver.org/","name":"Appweb Embedded Web Server","note":"Appweb for Dynamic Applications\n\nA new class of web server designed solely for dynamic web applications\n\n\n\nFast, Compact, Efficient\n\nAppweb has a multi-threaded, event-driven, core to deliver exceptional throughput, response and outstanding memory utilization. It is compact and will embed using as little as 800K of memory.\n\nDynamic Web Frameworks\nAppweb supports in-memory modules for hosting PHP and Ejscript with more modules coming.\n\nServer-Side Javascript\n\nAppweb includes the new Ejscript web framework for server-side Javascript web applications. Why learn a new language when you can use the same language on the server as in the browser.\n","tags":""}
