{"url":"http://www.mythtv.org/wiki/MythPhone","name":"MythPhone - MythTV","note":"MythPhone makes it possible to have videocalls from your living room on the big (flat)screen. This is a great way to talk to friends and family. All this is possible just a push away on your remote control. When you talk with people, face-to-face, kinda like if they were there. It gets you much closer to each other, and its easier, you don't have to type. Combined with a good webcam (e.g. logitech Quickcam pro 9000) you get excellent results (HD quality). Videocalls are great to talk, almost as in real life, to family or friends who live at some distance from you. So look out, this can get very addictive. MythPhone makes it also possible to have normal phone calls using VOIP (voice over IP). USB-Webcams must support Videomode YUV422P or RGB24 (Mythphone at release 0.21)\n","tags":"opera"}
