{"url":"http://psi-im.org/","name":"Psi - The Cross-Platform Jabber-XMPP Client For Power Users","note":"Psi is a multi-platform and standards-based instant messaging client available for Windows, Linux, Mac and more.Psi is a free instant messaging application designed for the Jabber IM network (including Google Talk). Fast and lightweight, Psi is fully open-source and compatible with Windows, Linux, and Mac OS X.With Psi's full Unicode support and localizations, easy file transfers, customizable iconsets, and many other great features, you'll learn why users around the world are making the switch to free, open instant messaging.\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://code.google.com/p/long-qq-for-linux/","name":"long-qq-for-linux - Google Code","note":"LONG(中文代号：龍)是一款跨平台的即时通讯软件,基于QT4,可以和腾讯QQ的用户进行通讯. QT是一个跨平台的图形界面库，可以运行于大多数主流的平台上,如linux,windows,mac os,以及各类嵌入式系统, 它非常适合跨平台软件的开发. 2. 要实现与腾讯QQ的通讯,协议分析是十分重要的一部分. 腾讯QQ主要基于UDP,TCP,也有HTTP,它的协议有些复杂, 每一步都对数据进行了加密,用了两个加密算法MD5和TEA(想了解TEA细节，可以baidu一下),因此分析起来有些困难. 但已经 有很多前辈做了这些工作，我们只要看一下文档就可以了\n","tags":"opera"}
