{"url":"http://www.bb4win.org/","name":"BB4Win","note":"A New Blackbox for Windows mod |We hail yet another Blackbox for Windows clone/build/branch – must be the 8th or 9th so far. Built by unkamunka, BB4Win Mod has a new bbcore philosophy and some new interesting features, some of them in the eye candy department, since it boasts no less than 12 new style syntax options – though at least two of them (splitvertical and mirrorhorizontal) we have already seen in noccy/elite force builds. Recently, unkamunka updated RC1, replacing it with RC2.More specifically, this version (BB4Win Mod 1.18 RC2) includes:• Enabled 12 multi-colour gradients• Upgraded image rendering (including 24-bit &amp; 32-bit colour options)• Processes menu - including Kill menu (credits to Alex3D &amp; nocd5)• Settings menu rationalised: merger of \"Blackbox menu\" with Configuration menu• Settings Menu access to edit all local plugin.rcs &amp; submenus• Alpha values now configurable on a 1-8 scale• Styling option: Menu.Title.FontHeight &lt;2 removes titles• Styling option: Enabled wildc...\n","tags":"opera"}
