{"url":"http://www.freevps.com/","name":"FreeVPS - Free Virtual Private Server Solution from Positive Software","note":"FreeVPS - a free Linux-based software that implements virtually isolated standalone servers on one host box.FreeVPS is a free Linux-based software implementing virtual servers technology, a cost-effective and resource-saving solution that runs virtually isolated full-featured standalone Linux servers on one host box. more...FreeVPS is released under the GNU General Public License (GPL). To ensure complete isolation of virtual servers, each is given a certain portion of the filesystem, a separate root directory where all its processes run restricted from other virtual servers, and own virtual network connections. more...FreeVPS is fully integrated with H-Sphere, an automated scalable web hosting software. H-Sphere provides an easy-to-use web interface to manage VPS configuration and hosting facilities. more...\n","tags":"opera"}
