{"url":"http://www.caferadius.com/","name":"CafeRadius - Take control of your hotspot!","note":"CafeRadius is an all-in-one hotspot management tool that let's you take control of your publicly available wireless connection. Designed to run on embedded devices such as the WRAP/ALIX and Soekris boards, CafeRadius is an inexpensive and lightweight solution to your hotspot needs. Create group and individual accounts, print access cards, define usage time limits, bandwidth limits, and data limits all within in an easy to use web interface.CafeRadius 可以在无线接入点和你的internet网关之间做一个基于用户web认证门户控制点，只有合法的用户通过口令验证以后才被允许访问internet。 [点击图片可在新窗口打开] CafeRadius 可以限制每一个用户的可使用时长、上传下载速率、可使用的流量等等，这些相关的参数都可以在web界面中很容易的设置。你可以设置一个群组，或者添加一个静态用户，或者保留详细的系统日志。总而言之，一般的认证和控制功能都集成进了CafeRadius中，不需要另外的radius系统。\n","tags":"opera"}
