{"url":"http://toxtox.tv/","name":"Toxtox","note":"The TOXTOX browser is a Mozilla based 10 foot browser for your television. Packed with features, it will provide a real multi-media experience for your bed- or livingroom while its controls remain easy and accessible with a keyboard or a remote control. With built-in support for Jabber/XMPP, TOXTOX will be a platform for new and innovative social and interactive media, enabling your TV with real 2.0 power. Users can customize TOXTOX the way they like it to work and look by installing user-contributed addons and themes. Currently TOXTOX is still in ist early stages of development. A 'stable' version is released every now and then. To keep up with the latest features - and you don't mind a minor itch - a nightly build or a fresh checkout from subversion trunk are the best choices.ToxTox是一个媒体浏览器/网络电视平台。您可以观赏您最喜爱的（互联网）电影和控制它们的遥控器，或使用ToxTox作为一个平台\n","tags":"opera"}
