{"url":"http://python-rq.org/","name":"RQ: Simple job queues for Python","note":"RQ (Redis Queue) is a simple Python library for queueing jobs and processing them in the background with workers. It is backed by Redis and it is designed to have a low barrier to entry. It should be integrated in your web stack easily. RQ requires Redis &gt;= 2.2.0.\n","tags":"rq,python,queue,system,redis,programming,celery,library,opensource,python queue"}
