{"url":"http://code.google.com/p/ganeti/","name":"ganeti - Project Hosting on Google Code","note":"What is GanetiGaneti is a cluster virtual server management software tool built on top of existing virtualization technologies such as Xen or KVM and other Open Source software. Ganeti requires pre-installed virtualization software on your servers in order to function. Once installed, the tool will take over the management part of the virtual instances (Xen DomU), e.g. disk creation management, operating system installation for these instances (in co-operation with OS-specific install scripts), and startup, shutdown, failover between physical systems. It has been designed to facilitate cluster management of virtual servers and to provide fast and simple recovery after physical failures using commodity hardware. FeaturesGaneti provides the following features for managed instances: Support for Xen virtualization: Support for PVM and HVM instances Live migration support Virtual console (on PVM) or VNC (on HVM) to control instances Support for virtio or emulated devices Support for KVM v...\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://code.google.com/p/mysqloa/","name":"mysqloa - Project Hosting on Google Code","note":"Mysql Optimize Analysis Description为什么要开发这个MySQL 优化工具(Why) “一键优化”功能，可以优化本地/远程需要优化的机器，将繁琐的优化工作“傻瓜”式操作根据您的业务需求Step By Step深度的优化 MySQL 服务器参数，起到指引的作用，简化用户操作(在正式版本发布)不可能完全记住MySQL中的300多个配置参数每个的作用，在配置管理时就可以知道每个参数的作用，起到指引的作用查看手册或者去google还是比较繁琐，输入关键字检索，很快就可以找到，配置信息的内容和参数通过web界面修改MySQL配置参数，简化操作修改配置信息不需要重启直接生效，可以反复修改，所见即所得，提高效率修改数据库配置需要有一定的先决条件，现在只要打开一个浏览器就可以根据机器、操作系统信息推荐需要配置优化的参数，起到指引的作用，简化用户操作一般什么人会使用(Who)数据库管理员系统运维管理员程序员怎么使用(How)通过web界面操作在任何位置的MySQL服务器\n","tags":"opera"}
