{"url":"http://code.google.com/p/lrcdis/","name":"lrcdis - Google Code","note":"lrcdis is a bash script for auto download lyrics and display it. compatable with most linux players.Now compatable with mpd, mocp, audacious, amarok, exaile, quodlibet, rhythmbox, mplayer.Now supply these display mode: CLI: colorful command line method.OSD: using gnome-osd-client, give a on-screen-display.notify: using notify-send, give a series of message boxs.fifo: output a fifo file /dev/shm/lrcfifo, which can be used by other program.title: display lyrics on terminal's title, such as gnome-terminal.echo: directly output lyrics, without any beautify.\n","tags":"opera"}
