{"url":"http://eishn.blog.163.com/","name":"蜻蜓点水 举重若轻 - 沈崴 - 网易博客","note":"张秀才,Vi 编辑器快速上手,关于 WSGI,[全文整理] 二千年传承的古武术秘密,收回此前对浦发银行的推荐,曹操、诸葛亮太难演了,用 Python 写自己的 C Module,中國書畫史半部在湖州,上海 python 聚会,[热烈庆祝][转贴] 清华大学与微软签3年协议 软件全面正版,沈崴的网易博客,君子终日乾乾,Linuxer blog\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://piwik.org/","name":"Piwik - Web analytics - Open source","note":"Piwik is a downloadable, open source (GPL licensed) web analytics software program. It provides you with detailed real time reports on your website visitors: the search engines and keywords they used, the language they speak, your popular pages… and so much more. Piwik aims to be an open source alternative to Google Analytics.Piwik is a PHP MySQL software program that you download and install on your own webserver. At the end of the five minute installation process you will be given a JavaScript tag. Simply copy and paste this tag on websites you wish to track (or use an existing plugin to do it automatically for you).Piwik是一款利用Php+MySQL技术构建的开源网页访问统计系统，它的目标就是想成为Google Analytics的替代品，而它的前身就是phpMyVisites。Piwik可以给你详细的统计信息，比如网页浏览人数, 访问最多的页面, 搜索引擎关键词等等，并且采用了大量的AJAX技术，使得在操作上变更加便易。另外，它还采用了插件扩展及开放API模式，这样开发者就可根据自已的需求来创建更多的功能，\n","tags":"opera"}
