{"url":"http://www.avidemux.org/","name":"Avidemux.org","note":"Avidumux是一个开放源代码的跨平台视频编辑软件，遵循GPL协议。功能[编辑]支持输入格式文件格式：AVI，OpenDMLASFFLV图片（BMP，JPEG，PNG）MatroskaMPEG PS, TSNuppelVideoOGMQuickTime，MP4，3GPP视频格式：CinepakDVFFV1H.263H.264/MPEG-4 AVCHuffYUVMPEG-1，MPEG-2MPEG-4 Simple Profile/Advanced Simple Profile（支持编码 FourCCs: DIVX, DX50, XVID, FMP4, M4S2）MJPEGMSMPEG-4 v. 2 (FourCC DIV3)Raw RGBSVQ3VP3VP6F（通过 libavcodec）WMV 2音频格式：AACAC3AMR narrow bandMP3，MP2VorbisWAV PCMWAV LPCMWMA[编辑]支持输出格式文件格式：AVI（单声道或双声道）Flash Video图片（BMP，JPEG）Matroska (Beta)MP4MPEG（VCD／SVCD／DVD 兼容）OGM视频格式：FFV1H.263H.264/MPEG-4 AVC（使用 x264）HuffYUVMPEG-1，MPEG-2MPEG-4（SP/ASP，使用 FFmpeg MPEG-4 或 Xvid）MJPEGSnow音频格式：AACAC3MP3，MP2Ogg VorbisWAV PCMWAV LPCM\n","tags":"opera"}
{"url":"http://pypi.python.org/pypi/requests","name":"requests 0.14.0 : Python Package Index","note":"Requests is an ISC Licensed HTTP library, written in Python, for human beings.\n\nMost existing Python modules for sending HTTP requests are extremely verbose and cumbersome. Python's builtin urllib2 module provides most of the HTTP capabilities you should need, but the api is thoroughly broken. It requires an enormous amount of work (even method overrides) to perform the simplest of tasks.\n","tags":"tweetthis python "}
