{"url":"https://github.com/skynetservices/doozerd","name":"skynetservices/doozerd · GitHub","note":"Golang编写的类似zookeeper服务 Doozer is a highly-available, completely consistent store for small amounts of extremely important data. When the data changes, it can notify connected clients immediately (no polling), making it ideal for infrequently-updated data for which clients want real-time updates. Doozer is good for name service, database master elections, and configuration data shared between several machines. See When Should I Use It?, below, for details.\n","tags":"golang,cluster,ha"}
